"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>埃及河</h1><ol><li><p>在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen15:18\">創世記十五章18節</a>中，埃及邊界的別稱（可能是指尼羅河<span>〔</span>Nile River<span>〕</span>）。</p></li><li><p>埃及小河（the brook of Egypt）的別稱。<em>見</em><span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"3515\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">埃及小河</span>。</p></li></ol>",
