"content": "<h1>艾*</h1><p><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen12:8\">創世記十二章8節</a>和<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen13:3\">十三章3節</a>中出現的迦南城市，有些英文譯本譯作Hai。<em>見</em><span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"2647\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">艾城</span>。</p>",
